  <item>
    <title>EP43 和译者陈磊聊心理咨询：情绪、创伤和自我觉察</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cee03ce924d4525aa08522</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cee03ce924d4525aa08522</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 13:00:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨，大家好，这一期我邀请到的嘉宾是《老友爱人和大麻烦》的译者—陈磊，我们聊了聊心理咨询对他的改变以及他和咨询师的关系，本期内容包括：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> 陈磊选择咨询师的标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 咨询是比较好的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="379">06:19</a> 咨询带来的好的改变，是如何发生的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a> 在咨询时会感到羞耻吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">12:24</a> 生活中的创伤反应：看到朋友的朋友圈，感觉非常伤痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1268">21:08</a> 咨询师分享的哪些方法，对现在的“负面情绪”依然起效</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1376">22:56</a> "存款让我没有安全感"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> 会在网上搜咨询师的社交帐号吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">25:07</a> 会在咨询之外想起咨询师吗，会想自己是不是TA最独特的来访者吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1559">25:59</a> 会担心被咨询师抛弃吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1606">26:46</a> 对咨询师有不满的时刻吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> 一直和同一个咨询师保持咨询的好处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a> 如果咨询师没有和来访者相同的经历，咨询师如何理解来访者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1757">29:17</a> 会在某个时刻产生"我也想成为咨询师"的念头吗</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/613499ebbfd0d9479f259746/lhrO3Z6VIknNqDrHb_RnjcFi7sm6.m4a" length="28847253" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:29:33</itunes:duration>
