  <item>
    <title>EP40 下水道老鼠的日常</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66719883b6a8412729af57c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66719883b6a8412729af57c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Jun 2024 14:24:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨，大家好。我时常感觉自己像是下水道里的老鼠，阴暗潮湿，还因此发过一条微博，没想到霍德曼同学也觉得自己是下水道里的老鼠，于是两只老鼠相认了！从那之后，我收集了很多“下水道里的老鼠”。</span></p><p><span>霍德曼同学的播客：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6245a53cbc68ab1e46764460" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6245a53cbc68ab1e46764460"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 两个下水道的老鼠相认了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">04:37</a> 鼠鼠时刻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> 听到“精英”播客</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> 看到“精致”动态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a> 经常和别人比较就很鼠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 通过阅读对抗嫉妒情绪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> 反反复复的情绪耗费掉很多精力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a> 内向小孩难逃鼠运</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> 为了维护淑女形象真的付出了很多努力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 一面朝上努力一面朝下内耗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> 团结鼠鼠创造一个下水道里的新世界</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 觉得自己一直在表演</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2393">39:53</a> 从下水道拉出我的是独处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2637">43:57</a> 大自然和运动把我从下水道中拉出来</span></p><p><span>本期节目提到的影视、书籍：</span></p><p><span>影视：</span></p><p><span>性爱自修室 第四季（2023）</span></p><p><span>书籍：</span></p><p><span>隐痛 [法]伊内丝·巴亚尔</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljme7ppltqzxgzO8EVxNhjtY73uj.m4a" length="49759195" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fol4c3tBBYU_1KCA1Yv0bvYBDqRy.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
