  <item>
    <title>EP39 博士日志2023 | 荷兰读博，缓解压力的种种尝试</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66470c70251bd96e6cf91ddf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66470c70251bd96e6cf91ddf</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 May 2024 07:51:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨大家好，这是去年录的【博士日志】系列的最后一期。本期嘉宾是小鱼同学，本期话题包括：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 最开始是因为什么想要读博的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> 小鱼同学遇到的同辈压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">01:53</a> 通过哪些方式缓解同辈压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 如何调整才能做到“要和自己比不和别人比”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">04:14</a> 心理咨询、同学提供了哪些方法或者安慰，让小鱼同学心态变好了一点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a> 怎样鼓起勇气与导师沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> 读博期间，感到最幸福的一件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 读博期间，感到自信的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="739">12:19</a> 其他缓解压力的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">14:52</a> 读博期间犯过的印象深刻的错误</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="993">16:33</a> 读博期间，最大的收获是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 推荐一个喜欢的食物和一本喜欢的书</span></p><span></span><p><span>（1）红树莓</span></p><span></span><p><span>（2）《伯恩斯新情绪疗法》</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>博士日志2022</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63145705433755901224111b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63145705433755901224111b"><span>EP06 博士日志 | 读博是一种使命的召唤，我和知名老总是同行</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6319c2e4e50e37575adb1ecd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6319c2e4e50e37575adb1ecd"><span>EP07 博士日志 | 享受读博，每天起床都很开心&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63230ce0684816f360ee0f97" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63230ce0684816f360ee0f97"><span>EP08 博士日志 | 不用做实验的化学博士的打怪升级</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/634023939186d4e4c46a0c0d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/634023939186d4e4c46a0c0d"><span>EP09 博士日志 | 空闲但焦虑、自信又自卑、痛苦并成长的文科博士生活</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/634816ed9186d4e4c46a103f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/634816ed9186d4e4c46a103f"><span>EP10 博士日志 | 我的研究哪怕对某个大牛有一点点启发，我都觉得有意义</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/635242a39186d4e4c46a15e7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/635242a39186d4e4c46a15e7"><span>EP11 博士日志 | 慢慢走，一步一步往前走</span></a></p>]]></description>
