  <item>
    <title>EP38 高敏感的生活，是我想太多？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6618064f48c40e2fb0bdb43c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6618064f48c40e2fb0bdb43c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Apr 2024 15:48:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨，大家好，这一期我和霍德曼同学一起聊了聊高敏感的生活。相信各位高敏感的小伙伴也有被人说过“你想太多了”的经历 (T_T)</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期话题包括：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a> 第一次接触到高敏感这个概念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> 不喜欢除夕的烟花：直击心灵，好像在骂我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 感觉自己什么都做不好(T_T)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">07:36</a> 充满掌控感的大学、研究生生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">11:14</a> 受高中老师影响，觉得自己是笨蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1012">16:52</a> 沉浸在自己脑海中的世界，很容易被吓到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a> 作为高敏感人士自洽的一点：灵感和创造力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1605">26:45</a> 对批评很敏感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1858">30:58</a> 不喜欢被观察(T_T)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1962">32:42</a> 察言观色(T_T)</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢霍德曼画的萌萌的封面图片！</span></p>]]></description>
