  <item>
    <title>EP37 博士日志2023 | 痛苦或者快乐都是会过去的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658acb2d6396a4645a2ca490</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658acb2d6396a4645a2ca490</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Dec 2023 12:46:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是【博士日志2023】系列的第四期。本期嘉宾是小朱同学，本期话题包括：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> 小朱同学读博的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> 读博期间，感到幸福的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 如何调节孤独的情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 读博期间，取得的令自己满意的成果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="501">08:21</a> 花了两年多的时间适应新环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">10:19</a> 读博的痛苦来源于哪些方面</span></p><span></span><p><span>（1）适应环境</span></p><span></span><p><span>（2）科研的压力</span></p><span></span><p><span>（3）对未来的迷茫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 缓解压力的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1012">16:52</a> 同辈压力：矛盾不该在我们两个之间，该在我们和外界之间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a> 逛博物馆很开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a> 读博期间的收获：学会独处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a> 推荐一个喜欢的食物和一本喜欢的书</span></p><span></span><p><span>（1）逛国博后吃到的桂林米粉</span></p><span></span><p><span>（2）《平凡的世界》</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>博士日志2022：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63145705433755901224111b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63145705433755901224111b"><span>EP06 博士日志 | 读博是一种使命的召唤，我和知名老总是同行</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6319c2e4e50e37575adb1ecd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6319c2e4e50e37575adb1ecd"><span>EP07 博士日志 | 享受读博，每天起床都很开心&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63230ce0684816f360ee0f97" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63230ce0684816f360ee0f97"><span>EP08 博士日志 | 不用做实验的化学博士的打怪升级</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/634023939186d4e4c46a0c0d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/634023939186d4e4c46a0c0d"><span>EP09 博士日志 | 空闲但焦虑、自信又自卑、痛苦并成长的文科博士生活</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/634816ed9186d4e4c46a103f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/634816ed9186d4e4c46a103f"><span>EP10 博士日志 | 我的研究哪怕对某个大牛有一点点启发，我都觉得有意义</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/635242a39186d4e4c46a15e7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/635242a39186d4e4c46a15e7"><span>EP11 博士日志 | 慢慢走，一步一步往前走</span></a></p>]]></description>
